        <section class="sheet sheet--grid chapter-copy" id="about">
            <h1>About me</h1>
            <p>It's crazy how things work. You stay up until 3am scrolling reels but what happens underneath for that to actually occur? I love digging deeper and asking what is going on underneath all of these layers.</p>
            <p>I’m pursuing my M.S. in Computer Science (specializing in Computing Systems) at Georgia Tech, where I finished my B.S. in May 2026. As the head TA for Operating Systems, I get to interactively work with students. Teaching makes me notice the steps I've started to take for granted, especially when someone asks a question I haven't thought to ask in a while.</p>
            <a class="ink-link" href="/resume">Read my résumé <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </section>

        <section class="sheet chapter-copy about-side">
            <h2>Outside the classroom</h2>
            <p>I grew up in Medford, Massachusetts, where I spent time on my high school’s robotics team and co-captained its science team. A lot of what I enjoy now still comes down to trying something with other people and seeing what we learn along the way.</p>
            <p>Away from my computer, I like cooking and baking, playing piano, and photography. I love capturing everyday moments to remind me what matters most in life. </p>
